2cw0KbfpIKZi84fKjLxzvwq2Flg&oe=69D63AF7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1_Sotial_Landscape.png", "id": "946248040391371", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974635_946248043724704_3567941048567794891_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7r1nJz1KCYEQ7kNvwFqYzaL&_nc_oc=AdrF-r4nEXr03smD4oXz8K-IHdg1DY7Gt8f-vAKBM_MUI0T_2fVHmb-ao8K37Ug0wlk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2evHtfddGTdaqqb6buNkGEk9caOchEshP-fwTjnwM-mw&oe=69D64856"}, "display_name": "Sotial", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Share and Experience the World in a New Dimension!\n\nSotial is a pioneering social media service that brings spatial video to your fingertips. From the everyday to the extraordinary, Sotial transforms your world into a captivating immersive experience.\n\nShare Your Immersive Journey: \n\u2022 Upload and Share: Capture a spatial video with an iPhone 15 Pro/Max or newer and share it with the world through Sotial.\n\nDive into Spatial Video:\n\u2022 Seamless VR Integration: Enjoy an immersive experience by watching spatial videos on your Quest VR headset.\n\u2022 Follow and Engage: Connect with friends and creators, follow their spatial video journeys, and never miss a moment in 3D.\n\nJoin Sotial today \u2013 where your world leaps into the new dimension of social media!\n\nNotes:\n\u2022 Capturing spatial videos requires an iPhone 15 Pro/Max or newer.", "short_description": "Share and Experience the World in a New Dimension!\n\nSotial is a pioneering social media service that brings spatial video to your fingertips. From the everyday to the extraordinary, Sotial transforms your world into a captivating immersive experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://about.amazevr.com/privacy-notice", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.amazevr.com/termsofservice", "publisher_name": "AmazeVR", "support_website_url": "https://amazevr.zende